WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:07.814
Your child writes each of the nine letters from days three and four, once. Then two words.

3
00:00:08.264 --> 00:00:10.819
Do not help on this page. Watch the pencil.

4
00:00:11.269 --> 00:00:16.390
At the bottom of the page is a row for you. Mark each letter that started at its green dot.

5
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.311
Then count your check marks.

6
00:00:18.761 --> 00:00:20.769
Seven or more, go on to day six.

7
00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:26.676
Fewer than seven, do days three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

8
00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:31.214
Then play the game on the next page. It is about the three kinds of letters.

9
00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:37.970
Your child colors tall letters blue, small letters yellow, and tail letters red, all the way along the path.
